"text": "You are wearing a cozy camel-colored dress made of silky viscose and TENCEL, featuring a high collar with a zipper detail that adds a modern touch. Over the dress, you have a relaxed camel cardigan that drapes beautifully, enhancing your silhouette without adding bulk. Your feet are adorned in dark brown ankle boots, providing both comfort and style for walking around the office or outside. Complementing the outfit is a large beige scarf with textured details, adding warmth and a touch of elegance to your ensemble.",
